# ==========================================================================
#  TEMPLATE ONLY — THIS FILE IS COMMITTED TO GIT.
#  DO NOT PUT A REAL KEY HERE. Put it in .env.local, which is gitignored.
# ==========================================================================
# Both passes default to DeepSeek (chosen by measurement - see PROGRESS.md).
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=...

# Optional: Gemini is fully wired as a fallback. Set MODEL_* to a gemini-* id to use it.
GEMINI_API_KEY=...

# Run `node scripts/list-models.mjs` to see what this key can reach, then set these.
# Defaults in src/lib/llm.ts are a starting point and may be stale.
# Provider is inferred from the model id: deepseek-* -> DeepSeek, otherwise Gemini.
# MODEL_EXTRACT=deepseek-flash     # Pass 1, normalisation (one call per live Skill)
# MODEL_REASON=deepseek-flash      # Pass 2, conflict reasoning
#
# Alternatives verified against the full case suite:
#   MODEL_REASON=deepseek-v4-pro     passes all 4, better prose, but 46-65s on some cases
#   MODEL_REASON=gemini-3.5-flash    passes all 4 (needs GEMINI_API_KEY)
# Run `node scripts/list-deepseek-models.mjs` to see what the key actually offers.

# Optional — defaults are in the code, you do not need these.
# BITGET_MCP_URL=https://datahub.noxiaohao.com/mcp   # no API key required
# BITGET_MCP_TIMEOUT_MS=12000
# CROSSCHECK_CACHE_TTL_MS=300000
